Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.70,0:00:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I see that you're\Nup ahead waiting there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.52,0:00:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.80,0:00:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,On this long journey that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.62,0:00:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,we've only barely begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.42,0:00:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Friendship, love, courage,\Nand a little bit of fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.36,0:00:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the things!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.10,0:00:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That even as the years go by!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.46,0:00:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Will not ever vanish from our minds!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.78,0:00:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We are all pieces of\Na single planet Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.98,0:00:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Little by little we can\Nfind each other's worth!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.04,0:00:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we see!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What sort of form we're meant to take!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.84,0:01:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All of us know the wind will\Nalways keep on blowing away!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the wind, feel it surround you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.54,0:01:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,As you finish what you've begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.52,0:01:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Look through that wind to dry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.58,0:01:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All the tears as you're breathing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.26,0:01:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The things you must overcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.16,0:01:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Join the quest, join the adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.56,0:01:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Found in meeting somebody new!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.72,0:01:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never stop for anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.76,0:01:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I see that you're\Nup ahead waiting there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.94,0:01:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.86,0:01:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All the tears you shed will help\Nyou to become so much stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.94,0:01:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All the tears you shed\Nwill help you to remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.44,0:01:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything, everything, everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.80,0:01:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now and forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.48,0:01:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the wind, feel it surround you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.66,0:01:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,As you finish what you've begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.56,0:02:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Look through that wind\Nto dry all the tears!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.58,0:02:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,As you're blaving the\Nthings you must overcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.30,0:02:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Join the quest, join the adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.68,0:02:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Found in meeting somebody new!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.14,0:02:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never stop for anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.28,0:02:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I see that you're\Nup ahead waiting there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.10,0:02:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.66,0:02:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All units, load up, move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.06,0:02:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Use your prison bullets!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.02,0:02:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to deal with Devil Fruit powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.44,0:02:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We've reached level 6, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.70,0:02:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Move in!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.88,0:02:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.82,0:02:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The ceiling?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.92,0:02:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Worry about that later!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.38,0:02:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Spread out and search the floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.20,0:03:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think they stuck around\Nhere after making that gigantic hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.68,0:03:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You morons!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.84,0:03:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiryu, the jail manager!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.18,0:03:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.09,0:03:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as plain as day!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.30,0:03:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do anything right without me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.70,0:03:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What a bunch of sorry excuses for jailers!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.62,0:03:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me give you a hint!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.14,0:03:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So maybe you can clean up this disgrace!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.54,0:03:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,While you were picking your noses!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.46,0:03:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The three prisoners you're looking for!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.90,0:03:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Release Crocodile and Jinbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.78,0:03:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and then climbed up through\Nthat hole to level five.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.28,0:03:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to pass along a message for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.24,0:03:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell Magellan I'll help him if he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.72,0:03:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.02,0:03:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.93,0:03:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.94,0:03:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They've escaped with Jinbe and Crocodile?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.44,0:03:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.35,0:03:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not in their cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.32,0:03:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.23,0:03:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that even\Nafter my brilliant plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.64,0:03:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,they somehow learned their\Nway out of level six?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.96,0:04:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And now they're a group\Nof five roaming wild
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.40,0:04:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and not sleeping like\Nthey're supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.58,0:04:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir, that's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.58,0:04:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I might be held\Nresponsible for any of this nonsense?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.02,0:04:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Warden Magellan is currently\Ntransporting Portgas D .A .s to the Navy,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.22,0:04:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'm afraid you'd be\Nresponsible for all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.24,0:04:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you were gonna say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.00,0:04:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm gonna get\Nout there and fight, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.76,0:04:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,All jailers report to Level 4 immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.42,0:04:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.33,0:04:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sadie, Saldeff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.25,0:04:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Gather your forces and head\Nto Level 4 this instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.74,0:04:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be warden even if\NI have to risk my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.96,0:04:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what am I saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.66,0:04:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop those criminals even if\Nyou have to risk your lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.04,0:04:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everybody ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.82,0:04:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Just so you know, even if we do\Nmake it to the top of the prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.10,0:04:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll still be in for one hell of a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.76,0:04:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We're completely surrounded\Nby the Calm Belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.14,0:04:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,which is impassable in any normal ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.64,0:04:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have to steal a Navy vessel if we\Nwant to go anywhere near their headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.66,0:04:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That means we need more\Npeople to join our team.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.46,0:04:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what you're thinking,\Nwe have lots already.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.66,0:05:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But to be honest, some of\Nyou won't make it out alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.96,0:05:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,By the time we reach the top floor,\Nmany of you won't be there to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.58,0:05:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're captured, you'll\Nbe tortured to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.08,0:05:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,There will be no mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.60,0:05:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So if we want to survive,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.88,0:05:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,we need to set free as\Nmany prisoners as possible
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.08,0:05:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,while we make our way\Nfrom here to level one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.32,0:05:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether we like them or\Nnot, we'll need their help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.74,0:05:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can cause enough\Nchaos to start a riot,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.12,0:05:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,it'll help keep those jailers occupied.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.32,0:05:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That means our first step\Non each floor is to open
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.54,0:05:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,the cells and let our new\Nfriends clear the way for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.12,0:05:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's give these boys hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.46,0:05:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Newcomer Land is going\Nto rattle this big cage
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.78,0:05:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,the likes of which\Nthey've never seen before!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.96,0:05:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.08,0:05:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready to rock this Straw Hat, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.28,0:05:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He went on ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.38,0:05:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A free spirit. Hee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.74,0:05:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's catch up to him, candies!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.46,0:05:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, somebody please stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.92,0:05:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.44,0:05:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's never been this past before!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.60,0:06:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, the hormone seems to\Nbe working a bit over time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.68,0:06:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, but check out those amazing moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.90,0:06:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.81,0:06:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.14,0:06:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.36,0:06:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just before 10 in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.08,0:06:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The execution is at 3 in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.56,0:06:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We can be certain that they'll do\Neverything in their power to stay on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.04,0:06:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So if Whitebeard is\Ngoing to make an attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.54,0:06:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,it's most likely that he'll\Ndo it as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.90,0:06:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace should already be on\Nthe ship and en route.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.14,0:06:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The war could break out at any second.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.50,0:06:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But they won't kill him\Nuntil three o 'clock, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.12,0:06:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That means we still have a\Nchance to get there and save him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.42,0:06:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.92,0:06:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this supposed to slow me down?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.30,0:06:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use my right hand\Nand turn this into sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.76,0:06:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go over how Crocodile's\NSansan devil crew power works.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.60,0:07:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He can turn into sand\Nas well as control it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.64,0:07:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,His right hand can suck\Nout any type of moisture.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.10,0:07:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,People and plants will wither away, while\Nrocks and earth will turn into sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.84,0:07:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.90,0:07:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Level 4 reporting in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.88,0:07:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe, the warlord who escaped\Nfrom Level 6 has been sighted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.30,0:07:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems we've reached the burning heat hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.40,0:07:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Alongside the intruder monkey, D.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.40,0:07:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.31,0:07:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, it's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.32,0:07:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The former warlord\Ncrocodile is here as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.14,0:07:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We're prepared to engage the enemy. Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.22,0:07:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.13,0:07:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Use the prison bullet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.64,0:08:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Far gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.30,0:08:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire the prison bullets!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.32,0:08:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.46,0:08:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.78,0:08:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishman Karate!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.26,0:08:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Karate!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.52,0:08:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.52,0:08:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.58,0:08:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel my arabesque brick fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.42,0:08:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat 2, Warlords?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.80,0:08:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.34,0:08:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't stand a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.34,0:08:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.42,0:09:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We outnumber them at least!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.82,0:09:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to hold out until\Nthe reinforcements arrive!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.32,0:09:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.23,0:09:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in a rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.68,0:09:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Should be fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.08,0:09:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a lot of commotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.14,0:09:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They just made an announcement,\Nbut I couldn't hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.94,0:09:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps something big\Nis happening downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.82,0:09:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, take a look, Buggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.14,0:09:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,All the jailers in the blue\Ncorner are making a retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.30,0:09:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All prison staff, head down to level four.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.10,0:09:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Something big must be happening\Non one of the other levels.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.44,0:09:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's our chance to make\Na break for it, partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.70,0:10:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a dream come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.06,0:10:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been through so much, haunted\Nby the army wolves in level five.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.64,0:10:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Between the wolves and the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.78,0:10:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And the latest indignity,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.68,0:10:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,pretending to be part of the\Nfloor to escape the wild beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.02,0:10:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been stuck in some cruel cosmic\Njoke as nothing but comic relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.94,0:10:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But we made it all the way to level two.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.76,0:10:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little bit further now,\Nand we'll be out of this hellhole.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.44,0:10:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, boys, ready to break out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.06,0:10:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.24,0:10:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My compliments to Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.88,0:10:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Three on these wax keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.62,0:10:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Some fine craftsmanship right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.94,0:10:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All guards report to level four.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.08,0:10:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Get me, team, in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.34,0:10:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in, Vice Warden.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.50,0:10:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the monitoring room.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.10,0:10:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Please come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.01,0:10:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.12,0:10:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This looks strange. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.68,0:11:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.92,0:11:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not as weird as it looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.36,0:11:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.27,0:11:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.19,0:11:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I secretly ordered this\Nfancy headdress to more
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.94,0:11:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,clearly assert my authority\Nwhen I became warden.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.30,0:11:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.21,0:11:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not talking about\Nyour weird headdress.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.14,0:11:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got a visual feed on someone\Nsneaking around on level to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.14,0:11:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And they look like prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.74,0:11:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.74,0:11:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,crap! The keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.98,0:11:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we can get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.12,0:11:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.03,0:11:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know how?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.95,0:11:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's your crocodile.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.10,0:11:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking about freaking\Nout of here, but I might need a
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.68,0:11:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,bit of assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.59,0:11:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And you, you're a man of\Naction, aren't you, Mr. One?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.22,0:11:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it,\Nthings are a bit boring here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.64,0:11:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I might take you up\Non that offer, old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.08,0:12:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.38,0:12:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.94,0:12:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank Captain Buggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.68,0:12:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Any guards left on two? Anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.66,0:12:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me if you're still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.86,0:12:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.04,0:12:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you doing anything\Ncrucial at the moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.68,0:12:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, we were just heading down\Nto level four, as ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.48,0:12:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Make a full inspection of\Nlevel two instead. This floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.02,0:12:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's our chance, partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.76,0:12:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.67,0:12:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the guards are\Ndistracted by the riot,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.60,0:12:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll sneak out of here and\Nstow away on a navy ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.62,0:12:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We're so close,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.53,0:12:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,and we'll go down in history for\Nbreaking out of this nightmare prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.96,0:12:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd wait just Straw Hat and Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.24,0:12:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Two are already dead by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.78,0:12:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Either that, or they'll spend the rest\Nof their miserable lives in this hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.74,0:12:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that sure is a sad thought right\Nthere, but at least we saved our own asses.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.82,0:12:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I've got eyes on Buggy the Clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.56,0:12:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Level two, look up! Look up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.76,0:13:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All right you guys if you want your\Nfreedom back this is your chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.40,0:13:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's tear this place apart fight\Nlike you got nothing left to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.26,0:13:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's kick it off, give it up for\Nour savior, yeah, Captain Buggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.50,0:13:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in level two here i don't know how but\Nthe prisoners are out of their cells and
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.38,0:13:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,They're out of control!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.98,0:13:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We need the Bacotti back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.42,0:13:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Send backup!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.24,0:13:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.26,0:13:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Level four here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.40,0:13:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.86,0:13:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We found Ivankov and Inazuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.14,0:13:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only that, but they've got\Nthe guy who tricked you with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.76,0:13:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.98,0:13:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.82,0:13:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't break me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.04,0:13:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't break it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.42,0:13:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They're storming level\Nfour with an entire mob!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.10,0:13:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What? A mob?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.00,0:13:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All staff, get down to\Nlevel four immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.74,0:13:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Every available guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.46,0:14:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna believe this,\Nbut the mob they've got with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.74,0:14:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all of the missing prisoners!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.88,0:14:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The inmates who've disappeared\Nover the years by demoning the war!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.44,0:14:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Try checking again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.34,0:14:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.86,0:14:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what I'm looking at!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.18,0:14:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.44,0:14:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally caught up with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.08,0:14:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Strawboy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.10,0:14:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Luffy? Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.76,0:14:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you got your\Njuices flowing again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.38,0:14:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.29,0:14:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm better than ever now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.28,0:14:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.44,0:14:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here, Mr. One?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.26,0:14:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.56,0:14:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that guy? Yeah! And so do you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.24,0:14:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Your swordsman Bunny defeated\Nhim back in Alabasta!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.66,0:14:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, not ringing any bells for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.14,0:15:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice warden, we need more\Nbackup on level four.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.68,0:15:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We also need more guys on level two.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.34,0:15:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.60,0:15:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Empire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.54,0:15:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Face growth synthesis!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.74,0:15:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.60,0:15:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.88,0:15:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, it's hot in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.64,0:15:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell, we!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.42,0:15:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There's too many!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.82,0:15:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't stop them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.36,0:15:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They're already vicious\Nenough when we lock them away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.08,0:15:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, they're vicious and super weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.28,0:15:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No time to explain,\Nbut we can't stop them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.78,0:15:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.04,0:15:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Straight to Navy Headquarters!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.22,0:15:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.66,0:15:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We've received word from Impel Down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.22,0:15:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,An unprecedented riot has broken\Nout and shut down the entire prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.44,0:16:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The ringleader of this revolt is\Nnone other than Monkey D. Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.58,0:16:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy the view while you still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.70,0:16:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you've been shackled onto the\Nscaffold, I can promise you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.90,0:16:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never see the sky again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.16,0:16:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Onigumo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.96,0:16:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We're now approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.58,0:16:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to open the gate of Marineford.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.78,0:17:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Fleet Admiral Sengoku! How did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.46,0:17:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We still haven't found him yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.66,0:17:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace's execution is five hours from now, so\Nwe don't exactly have time in our favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.68,0:17:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard could launch\Nan attack any moment now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.12,0:17:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We need a warlord on our side!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.32,0:17:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We've searched the whole island!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.56,0:17:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't find Blackbeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.26,0:17:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.20,0:17:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And this could be unrelated?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.08,0:17:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But we just received word of a Navy ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.18,0:17:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Arriving at Impel Down\Nwithout any clearance? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.46,0:17:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, sir, but what\Nare the chances it's him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.94,0:17:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.34,0:17:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't request any reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.90,0:17:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And we're in the midst of a state of\Nemergency. So we can't assure your safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.22,0:17:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We're waiting to hear back\Nfrom headquarters at the moment
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.34,0:17:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go pissing your britches.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.24,0:17:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all on the same side.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.76,0:17:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not the issue\NNo pirate is allowed to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.34,0:17:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,step foot inside the\Nprison even if you're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.32,0:18:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't bother holding it\Nback with these guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.00,0:18:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,After all?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.84,0:18:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the highest ranking officials here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.72,0:18:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about a gloomy place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.14,0:18:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.10,0:18:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,there's not a single crew member left\Nalive on the ship Blackbeard came in on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.44,0:18:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They're dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.12,0:18:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.98,0:18:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take another step!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.38,0:18:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Give an aim shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.24,0:19:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We have an intruder, the warlord\Nof the sea, Marshal D. Teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.56,0:19:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.74,0:19:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackbeard sucked them all\Nup and spit them back out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.34,0:19:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.02,0:19:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackbeard and his crew are\Nbreaking into the prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.18,0:19:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and I don't think we can stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.30,0:19:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The darkness, it swallowed me up all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.80,0:19:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,His motive is unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.58,0:19:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.78,0:19:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My entire life is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.66,0:19:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I wish it was over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.74,0:19:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just the beginning,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.16,0:19:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,the beginning of a miserable life in\Nwhich I never get to be the warden.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.24,0:19:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm doomed to be the\Nvice warden for eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.58,0:20:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, sir? What the\Nhell's wrong with him, Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.18,0:20:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and his followers on level four\NBuggy the clown leading a riot on
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.56,0:20:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,level two and the warlord\Nblackbeard busting through the main
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.64,0:20:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Gates what should i do how do i
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.80,0:20:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,even begin to deal with this mess
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.68,0:20:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This is feeling like a pretty good\Ntime to take a snack break are you nuts
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.80,0:20:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,we need to save the Prison now oh\Nyeah that's easy enough for you to say
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.08,0:20:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,oh i see you want to be the vice warden
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.28,0:20:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me what warden magellan
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.88,0:20:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, where are you? I'm on level two\Nand I've just taken care of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.04,0:20:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,fools this floor is clear
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.48,0:20:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,i've
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.94,0:21:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,blocked
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.85,0:21:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,off all of the exits on level two if
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.68,0:21:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,the poison Hasn't stopped them yet it
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.70,0:21:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,will soon enough no we're completely
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.20,0:21:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Blocked in the doorway's clogged. Of\Npoison, what do we do, Captain? Buggy, my
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.16,0:21:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,children you obnoxious toxic bastard\Nblast he'll find us If we stay here
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.42,0:21:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,as for blackbeard i haven't a clue\Nwhy he's attacking us but i'm already
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.28,0:21:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking care of things it's not something\Ni particularly wanted to do but i
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.26,0:21:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,wasn't given Any other options what do\Nyou mean it's not something you wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.90,0:21:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,to do against better Judgment i decided\Nto really sheet you to deal with
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.40,0:21:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,them are you insane possibly but we
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.58,0:21:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,can't Ask navy hq for reinforcements
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.92,0:21:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,we're left with no choice but to deal\Nwith this ourselves and as for You put
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.50,0:21:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,all of your efforts into getting level\Nfour under control i'll be heading
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.54,0:22:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,down to level four Soon enough until\Ni get there it's your master cleaner
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.02,0:22:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh! I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.94,0:22:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Order! Order!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.64,0:22:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Love the word!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.55,0:22:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, shouldn't we be going now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.54,0:22:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.46,0:22:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, feels good to step out\Nof that cell, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.40,0:22:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. It's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.36,0:22:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Lesson learned. All that boredom really\Nmakes you long for the excitement of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.82,0:22:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're not gonna use me as your pawn,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.30,0:22:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,only to toss my ass back in\Nthere once you're done with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.06,0:22:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Magellan?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.97,0:22:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a condemned prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.94,0:22:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is your one chance,\Nconsider it a deferred sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.28,0:22:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.46,0:22:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.52,0:23:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure I'm on my best behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.96,0:23:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's a sword. Jail manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.82,0:23:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,As for Blackbeard, he's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.02,0:23:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Works for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.94,0:23:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my lovely sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.34,0:23:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.00,0:23:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I got carried away there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.48,0:23:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.30,0:23:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They broke into the jailer's\Nroom and stole the keys!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.34,0:23:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, candy boys and candy girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.04,0:23:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a nice appetizer,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.44,0:23:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,but we're going to need chaos\Non every floor of this hellhole!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.20,0:23:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to make it out alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.48,0:24:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,then release every last prisoner\Nyou can and divide the enemy forces!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.26,0:24:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want out, now is the time. This is\Nyour best chance. It's now or never, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.44,0:24:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes I'm all yours lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.64,0:24:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Go Blugotti!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.58,0:24:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Run wild!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.96,0:24:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn the Blugotti! This\None's all yours, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.38,0:24:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,nice work don't stop go and beat\Nthat freak with a big bloated head
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.84,0:24:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,he's their leader hey my head is not\Nbloated it's face growth synthesis
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.38,0:24:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All he did was wink and he\Ntook him out in one shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.74,0:24:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding, I don't even get it, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.74,0:25:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He's scary, Straw Hat boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.56,0:25:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry you have to keep on running\Nforget about all these small fries.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.92,0:25:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We can handle them We need that\Nboat and we need you on it pronto.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.86,0:25:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move. Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.16,0:25:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.96,0:25:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the demon guards!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.10,0:25:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,They sent three of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.64,0:25:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, we got our backup! Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.94,0:25:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sadie is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.08,0:25:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end of the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.26,0:25:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So bow down, kiss my feet,\Nand take your punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.72,0:25:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I am admittedly better suited\Nto fighting underwater,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.50,0:25:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,but I shall assist you as best\NI can all the same, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.88,0:25:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.88,0:25:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem plenty strong to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.38,0:25:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Go make them suffer!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.98,0:25:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.00,0:25:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Without proper eyesight, even a demon\Nguard is nothing more than a lumbering oaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.34,0:25:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.38,0:25:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you like the eye crusher attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.34,0:26:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Them all at once. Oh, oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.34,0:26:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.80,0:26:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Simply pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.34,0:26:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.36,0:26:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.68,0:26:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They're too strong! Run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.96,0:26:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The candidates don't even face them!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.04,0:26:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.95,0:26:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going back to my cell!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.38,0:26:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't win enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.62,0:26:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.30,0:26:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They think they're way\Nstronger than the Blagoons!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.84,0:26:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Those screams!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.56,0:26:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.47,0:26:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,These demon guards are\Nquite the formidable foe.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.30,0:26:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Third gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.50,0:26:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishman, karate!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.44,0:26:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Demon guards, fight them out!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.64,0:26:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now come, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.66,0:26:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Die it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.48,0:26:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Five thousand, quick fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.36,0:26:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Fables!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.82,0:26:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Now falter!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.36,0:27:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise the drawbridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.84,0:27:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them cross it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.38,0:27:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.46,0:27:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the Blackbeard!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.26,0:27:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.17,0:27:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He may be a warlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.60,0:27:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's no way this was sanctioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.82,0:27:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackbeard is not on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.46,0:27:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.48,0:27:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.60,0:27:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirates are traitors\Nby nature, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.96,0:28:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Jail manager Shiryu, when\Ndid they let you out?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.26,0:28:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's see how this goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.78,0:28:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's this putz?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.52,0:28:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Some big shit looking for trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.86,0:28:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What Magellan? I presume you're\NMarshall D. Teach Black Beard, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.14,0:28:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.10,0:28:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.92,0:28:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.98,0:28:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't fight him\Nwithout the Demon Guards!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.18,0:28:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We're screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.26,0:28:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All speed ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.58,0:28:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can stop us now! Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.92,0:28:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like their\Nnumbers are increasing too!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.78,0:28:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Custer!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.86,0:29:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Team Guard ZD! Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.48,0:29:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Put you out of the way! Can it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.56,0:29:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's Mistress Sadie!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.32,0:29:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Manifesto of Excitement!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.92,0:29:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Red Viper Whip!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.20,0:29:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.22,0:29:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat on my sweet little...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.52,0:29:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Minions!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.44,0:29:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.22,0:29:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.50,0:29:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy, I told you to keep moving, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.76,0:29:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.44,0:29:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're fighting me now, naughty girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.62,0:29:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, sometimes I like a girl fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.72,0:29:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid anarchist.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.06,0:29:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're a woman, like I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.32,0:29:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Make up your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.28,0:29:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Pest.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.56,0:29:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.10,0:30:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Jealousy doesn't suit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.90,0:30:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, we're almost to the\Nstaircase leading to level three.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.06,0:30:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll open the door once we're there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.78,0:30:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.38,0:30:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.70,0:30:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The door's opening by itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.66,0:30:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.96,0:30:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck on our part.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.20,0:30:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just get to level three.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.14,0:30:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the great fortress of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.44,0:30:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,None shall pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.70,0:30:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now be gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.20,0:30:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's this, doofus?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.76,0:30:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd he open the doors all the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.14,0:30:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.42,0:30:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the vice-warden of the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.32,0:30:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.04,0:31:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.26,0:31:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got a thousand troops\Narmed with a thousand cage
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.18,0:31:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-shot bazookas packed into\Nthe stairway to level three.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.20,0:31:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the end of the line!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.30,0:31:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This is as far as you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.84,0:31:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to guarantee the safe\Nfuture of all innocent citizens,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.80,0:31:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,you, Straw Hat, must be eradicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.04,0:31:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I hereby sentence you to\Ndeath on behalf of the Warden.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.20,0:31:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be the same Vice Warden I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.78,0:31:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.38,0:31:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Try and make me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.14,0:31:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He actually knows what he's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.74,0:32:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And here, I thought he was\Nonly good at complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.92,0:32:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What? HENYA!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.28,0:32:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, the HENYA Hustle Dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.74,0:32:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Infernal Hell Wheel!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.20,0:32:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the hell out of my way! I'll make you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.94,0:32:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta save him!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.08,0:32:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta be joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.56,0:32:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of vice-war would I be if I\Nstepped aside just cause an inmate asked me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.22,0:33:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Second gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.42,0:33:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.16,0:33:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.80,0:33:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.16,0:33:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been praying you'd arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.24,0:33:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to do\Nsomething, Warden Magellan.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.92,0:33:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are the ringleaders\Nbehind this uprising?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.62,0:33:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They're in front of the\Nstaircase to level three.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.94,0:33:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's on the opposite\Nside of the floor from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.36,0:33:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and we're going to have to\Nfight our way through the riot.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.30,0:33:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So far, Vice Warden\NHannibal has kept him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.20,0:33:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows how long he can hold out?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.18,0:34:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Vice Warden!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.12,0:34:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.42,0:34:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not through with you yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.58,0:34:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.52,0:34:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow the vice warden's lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.08,0:34:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.44,0:34:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You should worry about\Nsaving your own life!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.38,0:35:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.30,0:35:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.90,0:35:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You are not getting past me!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.52,0:35:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Shams of Jet Tail!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.70,0:35:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.84,0:35:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Just quit already!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.16,0:35:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.07,0:35:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for this crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.64,0:35:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep saying you want to save your\Nbrother like it's some noble quest,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.12,0:35:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but I know you're nothing but scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.30,0:35:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.44,0:35:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,All the pirates and rebels here, you don't\Ngive a damn about anyone but yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.24,0:36:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop by Swarting! You've done enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.94,0:36:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.00,0:36:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna get killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.18,0:36:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as scum like you are\Nfree to terrorize the seas,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.72,0:36:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,decent people can't even\Nsleep at night because
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.94,0:36:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,they're worried about\Nlosing their loved ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.30,0:36:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This jail was built to protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.32,0:36:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Locking up evil criminals like you is the\Nonly way to give them some peace of mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.36,0:36:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This fortress is the floodgate of hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.64,0:36:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And I won't let the world drown in\Nterror by letting prisoners break free!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.78,0:36:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So like I already said, you\Nwon't take a single step!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.28,0:36:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye, sport!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.34,0:36:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing I want is to\Nsave my brother, so move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.84,0:36:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too dumb to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.72,0:37:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I started. Help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.30,0:37:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.21,0:37:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.78,0:37:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Buttercork in it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.42,0:37:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,All this blathering about what's\Nright and wrong in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.12,0:37:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'd look at the world\Nfrom outside your damn prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.76,0:37:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,it seems not so black and white.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.02,0:37:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So cut the crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.90,0:37:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.02,0:37:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I met him in Jaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.66,0:38:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow! Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.64,0:38:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, ain't this a fine\Ntrip down memory lane!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.24,0:38:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we got you boys right\Nin the middle of something!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.98,0:38:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.96,0:38:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind telling us what the\Nhell you're doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.38,0:38:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, or do you only\Nanswer to Blackbeard now?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.96,0:38:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.66,0:38:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, what's with the hostility?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.90,0:38:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you loosen up those fists there?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.38,0:38:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I forgot you\Nand Ace are pretty tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.50,0:38:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But hey, there's not much point\Nin caring about him anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.52,0:38:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackbeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.84,0:38:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.26,0:38:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm chasing someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.22,0:38:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a pirate named Blackbeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.38,0:38:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The dreams of pirates will never end!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.72,0:38:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,According to this,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.70,0:38:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,a pirate named Blackbeard defeated Ace\Nand gave him up to the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.80,0:39:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,In return, they invited\Nhim to be a warlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.74,0:39:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackbeard, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.28,0:39:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.30,0:39:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.76,0:39:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackbeard!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.90,0:39:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.62,0:39:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I never gave you my name, did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.18,0:39:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Long time no C, Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.72,0:39:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I know how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.54,0:39:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I was surprised myself when I heard you\Nwere my old commander's baby brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.72,0:39:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.30,0:39:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna miss the\Nbig show don't you want
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.12,0:39:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,to be there for your\Nbrother's public execution?
